cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference ADF, please cite it as below."
title: "ADF: agent effect security, a local control plane for coding agents"
abstract: >-
  A local control plane that decides, enforces and proves which effects a coding agent may perform on the
  developer's host. A deterministic PDP decides, a PEP revalidates at effect time, a confined runtime performs the
  minimal effect, and every decision leaves an Evidence Bundle that verifies offline.
type: software
authors:
